#. module: hr_attendance_telegram
#: model:res.groups,comment:hr_attendance_telegram.privilege_record_own_attendance
msgid ""
"Held by the attendance commands of a Telegram chat: find the sender's "
"employee, and read, start and close that employee's attendances at the time "
"they type, lunch break included. A linked user reaches only the employee "
"they are; a contact with no user only an employee without one whose contact "
"a Telegram account was ever bound to. Odoo's own check-in takes the current "
"time only, so the typed time is this privilege's."
msgstr ""

